  "HP 7475-style pen plotters, unlisted cutters": "HP 7475 类笔式绘图仪、未列出的刻字机",
  "Vanilla IN; SP1; PU/PD output — start here when the brand is unknown.": "标准 IN; SP1; PU/PD 输出——品牌不明时从这里开始。",
  "Force and speed are set on the machine panel (no HP-GL commands).": "压力与速度在机台面板设置（无对应 HP-GL 指令）。",
  "Job files start with the page-size number statement + CT1 (cut mode) — the Roland dialect does this automatically.": "作业文件以页面尺寸数字语句 + CT1（切割模式）开头——Roland 方言会自动处理。",
  "Overcut is set with TB (already exposed in the machine options as Roland overcut units).": "过切由 TB 设置（已在机器选项中作为 Roland 过切单位提供）。",
  "Serial is 9600 8N1; hardware flow control is not wired on the GX serial port.": "串口为 9600 8N1；GX 串口未接线硬件流控。",
  "Older firmware: keep speed ≤ 20 cm/s and avoid very long single statements.": "旧固件：速度保持在 ≤ 20 cm/s，避免超长单条语句。",
  "Often ignores status queries — a silent console log is normal on these.": "常忽略状态查询——控制台无应答属正常现象。",
  "Prefers PA (absolute plot) mode — the Graphtec dialect header includes it.": "偏好 PA（绝对绘图）模式——Graphtec 方言头部已包含。",
  "Serial wants XON/XOFF software flow control; the driver default is 9600.": "串口需要 XON/XOFF 软件流控；驱动默认 9600。",
  "Condition (force/speed) can also be set per-slot on the panel; FS/VS here override the active slot.": "压力/速度也可在面板按槽位设置；此处的 FS/VS 会覆盖当前槽位。",
  "USB shows up as a virtual COM port — baud is whatever the Graphtec driver exposes (often 19200/38400).": "USB 会呈现为虚拟串口——波特率以 Graphtec 驱动暴露的为准（常见 19200/38400）。",
  "This is the 文泰/Artcut ecosystem: Roland CAMM flavour at 9600 baud, no flow-control wiring.": "这是文泰/Artcut 生态：Roland CAMM 风格、9600 波特率、无流控接线。",
  "Tiny receive buffers — keep flow control on \"none (paced)\" so the app throttles itself; raw dumping drops bytes mid-job.": "接收缓冲极小——流控保持「无（自动限速）」让应用自行节流；裸灌会在作业中途丢字节。",
  "Most clones ignore OE/OH status queries; judge the connection by the self-test echo instead.": "多数克隆机会忽略 OE/OH 状态查询；请以自检回显判断连接。",
  "If corners lift, raise the TB overcut; if vinyl tears, drop force 10 gf at a time.": "翘角就加大 TB 过切；刻穿材料就每次把压力下调 10 gf。",
  "Speaks standard HP-GL for geometry; cutting conditions live on the panel (no reliable FS/VS).": "几何走标准 HP-GL；切割条件在面板设置（FS/VS 不可靠）。",
  "Prefers hardware handshaking when the cable supports it.": "线缆支持时优先硬件握手。",
  "HP-GL geometry works with the bare dialect; force/speed/offset are panel settings.": "几何用 bare 方言即可；压力/速度/偏移在面板设置。",
  "USB models expose a virtual COM port — 9600 works even when the label says otherwise.": "USB 型号会呈现虚拟串口——即使标签另写，9600 通常可用。",
  "GCC defaults to 19200 8N1 on serial; check Communication in the panel if jobs stall.": "GCC 串口默认 19200 8N1；作业卡住时检查面板的 Communication 设置。",
  "Force/speed/offset are set from the machine panel or GCC AAS software.": "压力/速度/偏移在机台面板或 GCC AAS 软件设置。",
